{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は幕張メッセで\n個別握手会だったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハロウィン前ということで\n仮装しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部、2部は一昨年も着た\n赤ずきんちゃんで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3、4、5部は今年買ったピエロ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部はストレート\n2部は三つ編み"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/30/5362162/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部はストレート二つ結び"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/30/5362162/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部はひつじさんヘア"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/30/5362162/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部は巻き髪！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/30/5362162/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいピエロの服だったよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪がなかなか治らなくて\n皆さんには心配や迷惑を\nおかけしてしまいすみません。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、頑張って最後まで出られてよかった\nって思った1日でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったし元気でました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/30/5362162/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花もありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16枚目での個別握手でも\nいろいろ仕掛けられるように考えるね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/30/5362162/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたは、らじらー！さんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1年ぶりにサンクエトワールの5人で\n出演します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レギュラーのひめちゃんに加え\nゲストとして\n未央奈、花奈さん、蘭世、私がでるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5人でサンクエトワール！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリラジさんのおふたりとサンクエトワール！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな回になるのか！\nたのしみですね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん絶対絶対きいてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンクエトワールの新曲"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「君に贈る花がない」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"も初解禁です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回、サンクエトワールで出させて頂いた時も\nものすごくたくさんのお便りや\nメールが届いたと\nスタッフさんとメンバーとみんなで\nよろこんでたんだよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたのらじらー！でも\n皆さんからのお便りやメールを\nお待ちしてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"過去最高のお便りやメールがきたらいいな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お便りやメールをみんなで読むのも\nラジオの楽しいところです(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜にはCSでのぎえいごも放送されます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お見逃しなく！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お聴き逃しなく、お見逃しなくだね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、きょうはこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあした！"}],"source":"archive"}